# Tab, Tab, Attack

## Objective
Navigate through long directory names using tab completion and retrieve the flag.

## Solution

- Extracted the ZIP file.
- Used the `Tab` key to autocomplete long directory names.
- Reached the executable file.
- Ran the binary to obtain the flag.

## Commands Used

```bash
unzip Addadshashanammu.zip
cd Add<Tab>
ls
./fang-of-haynekhtnamet
```

## What I Learned

- How to use Tab completion in Linux.
- How to navigate long directory structures efficiently.
- How to execute Linux binaries.
